# .claude/rules/deploy.rules
# Deploy rules for FlowTask Inc. Task Management Platform

## Deploy Stack
- Container registry: GitHub Container Registry (GHCR) — ghcr.io
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions — .github/workflows/ci.yml
- Server: Linux + Docker + docker-compose.prod.yml
- Deploy: SSH via appleboy/ssh-action

## Key files
- Dockerfile — production-grade image with uv + non-root user
- entrypoint.sh — Alembic migrations + seed + uvicorn (workers=1, SQLite single-writer)
- docker-compose.yml — local development (build from source)
- docker-compose.prod.yml — production (GHCR image, uses GHCR_IMAGE from .env)
- .env.example — environment variables template
- ready_to_deploy.md — full deployment manual

## Critical rules
1. NEVER commit .env — it is in .gitignore
2. SECRET_KEY generated with secrets.token_hex(32) — minimum 32 bytes
3. DATABASE_URL in production points to /data/ (persistent Docker volume)
4. workers=1 in uvicorn — SQLite does not support concurrent writes
5. ENVIRONMENT=production disables Swagger/ReDoc and enables cookie.secure=True
6. The sqlite_data volume is NEVER deleted — it contains the entire database

## CI/CD Flow
push main → tests (uv run pytest) → docker build → push GHCR → SSH deploy → health check

## Rollback
Change GHCR_IMAGE in server .env to sha-XXXXXXX tag and do pull + up -d

## Required GitHub Actions Secrets
- SERVER_HOST — server IP or domain
- SERVER_USER — SSH user
- SERVER_SSH_KEY — SSH private key (ed25519 recommended)
- SERVER_PORT — SSH port (default 22, optional)
- GITHUB_TOKEN — automatic, do not configure

## Production environment variables (see .env.example for full list)
- SECRET_KEY (required)
- DATABASE_URL (required, point to sqlite:////data/...)
- GHCR_IMAGE (required on server)
- ENVIRONMENT=production
- CORS_ORIGINS (server IP/domain)
